WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.204
Let's find our way around. Main brings you to Clips: tracks across, scenes down. This is where your parts come together.

2
00:00:07.284 --> 00:00:13.234
Hold Menu and press pad thirteen for Play. The top row takes you to the selected track's pages.

3
00:00:13.234 --> 00:00:22.735
A selects track one. Try pad one. Those same sixteen pads will play sounds, enter steps, or launch clips, depending on the page.

4
00:00:22.735 --> 00:00:29.080
Sixteen Level takes you straight to Steps. Main gets you back to Clips. Your notes stay with the project.

5
00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:36.761
Hold Menu and press pad sixteen for Sound. Choose Kit with pad thirteen, then press Q-Link and read the four knob labels.

6
00:00:36.761 --> 00:00:41.665
That's enough navigation to start making something. Back to Main, and let's put a beat on those pads.
